		Animation presets: none, fade, curve_fade, slide_left, slide_right,
		slide_up, slide_down. animation_in/animation_out may override each direction.
		animation_time, animation_hide_time and animation_delay are milliseconds;
		animation_distance is measured in screen pixels.

		Motion effects: none, parallax, panorama. motion_mouse_x/motion_mouse_y set
		the cursor reaction in pixels; motion_auto_x/motion_auto_y set autonomous drift.
		motion_speed is cycles per second, motion_smoothing controls response softness,
		and motion_phase sets the starting phase in degrees. Motion changes drawing only;
		the element position and hitbox stay unchanged.
